      pubblicit\xE0\r\nntf_mes_1\t\U0001F9F6 Pull some yarn, feel the joy!\t\U0001F9F6R\xFAt
      v\xE0i s\u1EE3i len, th\u1EA5y vui li\u1EC1n nghen!\t\U0001F9F6 Puxa um fio
      e sinta a alegria!\t\U0001F9F6 Biraz ip \xE7ek, ne\u015Fen yerine gelsin!\t\U0001F9F6
      Zieh ein paar F\xE4den und freu dich!\t\U0001F9F6 Tire quelques fils, et souris
      un peu !\t\U0001F9F6 Tarik benang sedikit, hati langsung senang!\t\U0001F9F6
      \xA1Tira un hilo y sonr\xEDe un poquito!\t\U0001F9F6 \u041F\u043E\u0442\u044F\u043D\u0438
      \u043D\u0438\u0442\u043E\u0447\u043A\u0443 \u2014 \u043D\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043E\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435
